# 问题 2 的选项\nA) 她觉得自己找到了灵魂伴侣 & 她无法相信小汤背叛了她\nB) 她觉得自己找到了灵魂伴侣 & 她不知道小汤出轨了\nC) 她不知道小汤出轨了 & 她不知道小汤是她的灵魂伴侣\nD) 她的朋友们支持她和小汤的关系 & 她无法相信小汤背叛了她\nE) 她觉得自己找到了灵魂伴侣 & 她用另一个男人背叛了小汤\nF) 她无法相信小汤背叛了她 & 她不知道小汤是她的灵魂伴侣","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.008574252101421315,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a7009aa9dc5a833d9b91","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794483968333,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:46:08","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"8f8844c7b8aa4cae92888bda8f66c0cd"}